WEBVTT

00:08:58.651 --> 00:09:01.258
jebkādu attaisnojumu, 
lai tikai neko neuzsāktu.

00:09:02.452 --> 00:09:05.496
Esmu to ļoti daudz dzirdējis:

00:09:06.570 --> 00:09:11.766
„Jā, es varētu veidot lielisku karjeru,

00:09:13.216 --> 00:09:14.536
bet

00:09:15.356 --> 00:09:16.756
es cienu

00:09:18.866 --> 00:09:20.233
cilvēku attiecības

00:09:20.257 --> 00:09:21.258
(Smiekli)

00:09:21.282 --> 00:09:23.350
vairāk nekā sasniegumus.

00:09:23.394 --> 00:09:25.752
Gribu būt lielisks draugs,

00:09:25.776 --> 00:09:28.020
lielisks laulātais,

00:09:28.044 --> 00:09:29.893
lielisks vecāks,

00:09:29.917 --> 00:09:32.036
un es to neupurēšu